OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's oldest person celebrates
OL,4,Aturning 117
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's oldest living person
OL,7,Fcelebrates turning 117 years old in
OL,8,FSurrey on Friday with her family and
OL,9,Ffriends.
OL,11,FEthel Caterham, who lives at Hallmark
OL,12,FLakeview Care Home in Lightwater, took
OL,13,Fon the mantle in April 2025 after the
OL,14,Fdeath of Brazilian nun Sister Inah
OL,15,FCanabarro Lucas at the age of 116.
OL,17,FBorn three years before the Titanic
OL,18,Fdisaster and eight years before the
OL,19,FRussian Revolution, Ethel has also
OL,20,Flived through two world wars.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
