OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's oldest person celebrates
OL,4,Aturning 117
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn addition, she is one of the oldest
OL,7,Fpeople to survive Covid-19, after
OL,8,Fcontracting it in 2020 at the age of
OL,9,F110, according to Guinness World
OL,10,FRecords.
